<h3 id="top-bar">Top Bar</h3>
<p>
	On the left side you can put Site Tagline <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Customize</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Site Identity</samp></kbd></kbd>, very useful for all kinds of slogans.
</p>
<p>
	The right side is top menu area so you can make a new menu in the <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Menus</samp></kbd></kbd>. You must choose <b>Top Bar Menu</b> theme location and that's it.
</p>
<p>
	To hide the top bar, go to <strong>Appearance &gt; Customize &gt; [PT] Theme Options &gt; Header &amp; Breadcrumbs</strong> and set <strong>Top bar visibility</strong> to <strong>Hide</strong>.
</p>